    - target: {fileID: 11318669537028838, guid: 310d28d6a9a74eb408a48a92bd119bde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: yesChoiceActions.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 11318669537028838, guid: 310d28d6a9a74eb408a48a92bd119bde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: <text>k__BackingField.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 11318669537028838, guid: 310d28d6a9a74eb408a48a92bd119bde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '<text>k__BackingField.Array.data[0]'
      value: I'm surprised you managed to find this, this is like really far out.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 11318669537028838, guid: 310d28d6a9a74eb408a48a92bd119bde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '<text>k__BackingField.Array.data[1]'
      value: Okay. It is possible you're currently out of fuel. In which case you're
        softlocked. Luckily for you, I've put a gas can directly to the left of this
        board. Go ahead and take it when you're done inspecting me!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 11318669537028838, guid: 310d28d6a9a74eb408a48a92bd119bde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '<text>k__BackingField.Array.data[2]'
      value: Why are you even here anyways? If it's to find secrets, theres nothing
        out here. Unless you count this as a secret, in which case, you would be..
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 11318669537028838, guid: 310d28d6a9a74eb408a48a92bd119bde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '<text>k__BackingField.Array.data[3]'
      value: Oh.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 11318669537028838, guid: 310d28d6a9a74eb408a48a92bd119bde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '<text>k__BackingField.Array.data[4]'
      value: I guess you would be right.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 11318669537028838, guid: 310d28d6a9a74eb408a48a92bd119bde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '<text>k__BackingField.Array.data[5]'
      value: Be careful not to fall off. There's no Hazard triggers out here. If
        you fall, you fall forever. How immersive!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 11318669537028838, guid: 310d28d6a9a74eb408a48a92bd119bde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: '<text>k__BackingField.Array.data[6]'
      value: If you're out here, I guess you've beaten the game. Have you had fun?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 11318669537028838, guid: 310d28d6a9a74eb408a48a92bd119bde, type: 3}
      propertyPath: <choiceLoc>k__BackingField.Array.size
